         (no mapped test)
         recommended test: The change includes a test that adds a mapped test and observes the obligation's enumerated defects remain unchanged.
           inputs:  Run the pipeline twice on the same base code and changed code, but between runs add a new mapped test that targets one obligation while leaving the changed production code unchanged. The added test must be enough to alter mapping/evidence inputs for that obligation, while another obligation remains untouched so the test can observe whether its enumerated defects stay stable.
